  The draft's reel_script and caption describe the 'ஸ்படிக' and 'சந்தன' necklaces as selling for ரூ.100 to ரூ.200 and then mention that 'இருமுடி பைகள்' sell for ரூ.250 'க்கு', which matches the article, but the draft's slides_spec line 'மாலை விலை ரூ.100 முதல் ரூ.200 வரை' applies the price to all bead types, which the article supports.
  The reel_script omits the article's detail that devotees bought items according to their preference and that the sales were brisk because of this; it does say devotees choose and buy, so this is covered.
